Recommends: linux-headers-generic | linux-headers
Homepage: https://github.com/Vyeche/Audra
Description: kernel driver for the RME Babyface Pro FS (DKMS)
 The snd-usb-babyface-pro ALSA driver for the RME Babyface Pro FS in its
 regular (proprietary) USB mode: audio at the full channel count, and the
 onboard DSP mixer's controls, which the Audra mixer app uses.
 .
 DKMS builds the module when this package is installed and again for each
 new kernel, as long as that kernel's headers are installed. The driver is
 by Ismail Bahloul. Not affiliated with or endorsed by RME.
